<title>NEW ZEALAND: Telecom buys back further 0.85 mln shares.</title>
<headline>Telecom buys back further 0.85 mln shares.</headline>
<dateline>AUCKLAND 1996-06-20</dateline>
<text>
<p>Telecom Corp of New Zealand Ltd said on Friday it had bought back 846,210 ordinary shares off market at NZ$7.35 per share on Thursday.</p>
<p>This brought the total number of issued shares in Telecom to 1,811,059,162, excluding 34,401,478 shares held as treasury Stock.</p>
<p>-- Wellington Newsroom (64-4-4734746)</p>
</text>
